# DUO-3244: single source of truth for every sandbox fixture's INNER
# site-repo .gitignore (siterepo/<pair>N/.gitignore) -- copy this file
# rather than hand-rolling a printf. Mirrors the OUTER duo-wp repo's own
# .gitignore exactly (state.capture.lock/-staging/-backup are
# agent/src/Publish.php's capture-lock artifacts, DUO-3213): a fixture
# missing state.capture.lock here hits a real, structural failure the
# moment a test captures on both sides of a pair before a git pull on the
# second side -- see DUO-3244 for the concrete repro.
.tmp*
state.capture.lock
state.capture-staging/
state.capture-backup/

# DUO-3232: env-bound value provisioning. `wp duo env-set` writes directly
# to wp_options and is never captured, so this file has nothing to do with
# the branchable-state contract above -- it exists purely as an optional,
# per-environment operator scratch file (name -> value) sitting next to
# site.duo.json on ONE environment's own checkout, never shared via git.
# See cli/README.md and cli/src/Doctor.php's own git-tracked hygiene check.
.duo-env-values.json
